<title>UK: Atkins, Scetauroute in Polish venture.</title>
<headline>Atkins, Scetauroute in Polish venture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's WS Atkins said on Monday that it had been awarded a 250 million stg roadway project in Poland in a joint venture with French firm Scetauroute.</p>
<p>The A4 motorway section connects Wroclaw and Nogawczyce in Poland.  </p>
<p>The project would include new construction plus the partial rehabilitation and widening of existing carriageways. Seventy new road bridges would be constructed and another 70 would be upgraded.</p>
<p>The four-year project would offer commission of eight million stg to the joint venture, Atkins said in a statement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
